prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:127:### 3.1 Grounding Need
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:128:Grounding Need exists when the answer materially depends on evidence not already dependable in the active context.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:130:### 3.2 Evidence Target
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:131:Evidence Target is the minimum evidence standard required to support the intended claim strength.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:134:Provenance is the inspectable source lineage of a claim, including where the evidence came from and why it was trusted.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:139:### 3.5 Evidence Coverage
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:140:Evidence Coverage is the extent to which the acquired evidence adequately supports the important parts of the answer.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:142:### 3.6 Source Conflict Trigger
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:143:Source Conflict Trigger occurs when retrieved sources materially disagree and the disagreement could change the answer or recommendation.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:145:### 3.7 Citation-Grounded Synthesis
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:146:Citation-grounded synthesis is synthesis that remains tied to actual retrieved evidence rather than conclusion-first paraphrasing.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:149:Agentic RAG is a retrieval mode in which a reasoning layer actively evaluates source quality, resolves contradictions, decomposes complex evidence needs, and may invoke additional retrieval or external tools when justified.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:151:### 3.9 Evidence Pack
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:152:An Evidence Pack is the minimized set of retrieved material passed into answer generation or downstream processing.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:154:### 3.10 Composite Evidence
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:155:Composite evidence is support assembled from multiple distinct fragments or sources because no single source sufficiently covers the claim.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:158:Currentness is the justified confidence that a retrieved source reflects the relevant present state rather than historical or stale context.
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:162:## [4] RETRIEVAL-FIRST DECISION MODEL
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:164:When this overlay is active, retrieval discipline should follow this logic:
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:166:`Detect Grounding Need -> Define Evidence Target -> Check Freshness Boundary -> Select Retrieval Mode -> Acquire Evidence -> Rank and Filter -> Slice Minimal Evidence -> Check Coverage and Conflict -> Build Evidence Pack -> Synthesize with Provenance -> Cite or Surface Limitation -> Stop or Escalate`
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:169:- do not retrieve before identifying what must be evidenced
prompt-stack/v32/harness/freezes/rg-2026-05-06-a/snapshot/prompt-stack/v32/02_overlays/PROMPT_retrieval_grounding_overlay.md:170:- do not synthesize before checking whether the retrieved evidence actually satisfies the `Evidence Target`
